Subject: How to use scaleClade and collapse for multiple clades
Message-ID: <FxFaoxt00zY.yIt1XmaqBAAJ@bioc-ggtree.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/bioc-ggtree/c/FxFaoxt00zY/m/yIt1XmaqBAAJ>
